# Multi-Agent PM Workflow Rules

- The Human Product Owner interacts ONLY with the Project Manager.
- Specialist agents report exclusively to the PM with bounded file ownership.
- Do not activate all specialists for every task; use minimal staffing.
- Run `node scripts/ai/doctor.js` to validate system integrity before completing project cycles.
